The canonical writer glues a code fence to its info string

````
``` php   "src/Auth.php"    [Composer]
composer require x
```
.
<pre title="src/Auth.php"><code class="language-php">composer require x
</code></pre>
````

````
```php "src/Auth.php" [Composer]
composer require x
```
.
<pre title="src/Auth.php"><code class="language-php">composer require x
</code></pre>
````
